{"title":"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/545d4a5225d2e86dfc3402d7d0082f5a4da57564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738914cb151e89f980f4eda782a2adaa4dc1b1dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4ff5852321b42830ffcb26a8143ebc07333c455.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 110 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 80 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 27 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the equation by subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides, and then plug x into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738914cb151e89f980f4eda782a2adaa4dc1b1dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa9e82dd32500dcb30bfc9b55e29629277f94dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 - 3 = 10 - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c67f3ce5fb886004007af414b7eea6e6df6df3a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 15 = 5 \\times 7 + 15 = 35 + 15 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"337\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f3665ec640cec334e9c351ecd4e9776d6a5c7040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 15 = 5x + 5 \\times 3 = 5(x + 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"257\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, we can simply multiply both sides of our equation to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get the answer:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f83062d9ab1cc3521e8dbadad03b7a1ebc49140.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(x + 3) = 10 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/0/880ce439e099db16ac382d7ba93520f417275386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 15 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>